# Personal, machine-specific overrides for the Taskfile.
#
# Copy this file to `.env` (which is gitignored) and adjust the paths to match
# your local setup. The Taskfile loads `.env` automatically via `dotenv`.
#
# You only need ONE of the two variables below:
#
# Option A (recommended): point at your platform-mesh/helm-charts checkout and
# let the Taskfile derive the kubeconfig path from it.
#PM_HELM_CHARTS_DIR=/<path-to-platform-mesh>/platform-mesh/helm-charts
#
# Option B: set the kubeconfig path directly (takes precedence over Option A).
#KCP_KUBECONFIG=/<path-to-platform-mesh>/platform-mesh/helm-charts/.secret/kcp/admin.kubeconfig
